            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty fyo:grid_v ],
        spo:TimeSlice ;
    skos:definition "Transport coefficient profiles for various time slices. The transport of particles, energy and momentum is described by diffusion coefficients, D, and convection velocities, v. In 1D (radial) equations, these are defined by the total fluxes of particles, energy and momentum, across a flux surface given by : V' [-D Y' <|grad(rho_tor_norm)|^2> + v Y <|grad(rho_tor_norm)|>], where Y represents the particles, energy and momentum density, respectively, while V is the volume inside a flux surface, the" ;
