fyo:ForwardOperator a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ForwardOperator" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf spo:Code ;
    skos:definition "The shared forward operator F — the equilibrium–transport–source forward kernel plus diagnostic-response composition mapping a plasma configuration θ to predicted state and synthetic signals F(θ). ONE operator shared by all five tasks (FYTOK-REPORT-107): synthetic diagnostics and equilibrium/profile inversion are unified as optimization / probabilistic inference over θ with loss ℒ(θ)=‖F(θ)−d_obs‖²_Σ; control-simulation state estimation and discharge-design trajectory optimization reuse the same F. A Code (GDC program), realized by ComputationalProcess runs." ;
    skos:inScheme fyo:scenario .

