            owl:onProperty fyo:consumes_ids ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty fyo:produces_ids ],
        spo:ComputationalProcess ;
    skos:definition "One engineering-port invocation — the \"经端口\" tier of the in/port/out engineering boundary (FYTOK-ADR-119 D3: single-direction-coupled machine engineering — system codes, whole-machine CAD, neutronics, structural FEM — is reached through ports, never implemented in-repo). Contract per FYTOK-ADR-126: THREE segments (prepare inputs → run → collect outputs) sharing no mutable state, with prepare/collect runnable and regressible when the external code is absent; the bidirectional parameter mapping (name · unit · direction · provenance) is DATA, not code; port dependencies are extras-isolated; port products land in existing IMAS DD carriers (produces_ids), never in parallel structures. First landed port = neutronics; the contract generalizes only after that single-point validation." ;
    skos:inScheme fyo:scenario ;
    fyo:adr_ref "FYTOK-ADR-119 D3 + FYTOK-ADR-126" .

