    skos:definition "A static description of a Machine as built — geometry, coil positions, probe positions (the machine-description IDS subset; EngineeringDetermination output). The DESCRIPTION-side counterpart of the MaterialEntity Machine: a survey dataset is_about the machine, while the drawing that PRESCRIBES it is a spo DesignSpecification. as-designed ≠ as-built ≠ the machine itself." ;
    skos:inScheme fyo:core .

