fyo:IDS a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "IDS" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:unionOf ( fyo:AmnsData fyo:BFieldNonAxisymmetric fyo:BalanceOfPlant fyo:Barometry fyo:Bolometer fyo:BreedingBlanket fyo:BremsstrahlungVisible fyo:Calorimetry fyo:CameraIr fyo:CameraVisible fyo:CameraXRays fyo:ChargeExchange fyo:CoilsNonAxisymmetric fyo:Controllers fyo:CoreInstantChanges fyo:CoreProfiles fyo:CoreSources fyo:CoreTransport fyo:Cryostat fyo:DatasetFair fyo:Disruption fyo:DistributionSources fyo:Distributions fyo:Divertors fyo:EcLaunchers fyo:Ece fyo:EdgeProfiles fyo:EdgeSources fyo:EdgeTransport fyo:EmCoupling fyo:Equilibrium fyo:Ferritic fyo:Focs fyo:GasInjection fyo:GasPumping fyo:GyrokineticsLocal fyo:HardXRays fyo:IcAntennas fyo:Interferometer fyo:IronCore fyo:LangmuirProbes fyo:LhAntennas fyo:Magnetics fyo:Mhd fyo:MhdLinear fyo:Mse fyo:Nbi fyo:NeutronDiagnostic fyo:Ntms fyo:OperationalInstrumentation fyo:Pellets fyo:PfActive fyo:PfPassive fyo:PfPlasma fyo:PlasmaInitiation fyo:PlasmaProfiles fyo:PlasmaSources fyo:PlasmaTransport fyo:Polarimeter fyo:PulseSchedule fyo:Radiation fyo:RealTimeData fyo:ReflectometerFluctuation fyo:ReflectometerProfile fyo:Refractometer fyo:RunawayElectrons fyo:Sawteeth fyo:SoftXRays fyo:SpectrometerMass fyo:SpectrometerUv fyo:SpectrometerVisible fyo:SpectrometerXRayCrystal fyo:Spi fyo:Summary fyo:Temporary fyo:Tf fyo:ThomsonScattering fyo:TransportSolverNumerics fyo:Turbulence fyo:Wall fyo:Waves fyo:Workflow ) ],
        spo:InformationContentEntity,
        spo:ProvenanceMixin ;
    skos:definition "An IMAS Interface Data Structure occurrence as a whole — the root ICE every lifted per-IDS schema (this schema/ directory, dd2fyo) subclasses. An IDS is ABOUT the Machine / Plasma / Discharge it describes (spo is_about) and carries orthogonal provenance + data modality (measured / reconstructed / simulated / static-device) via ProvenanceMixin — the DD schema itself is modality-blind. Its time mode (homogeneous_time) is a layout choice (AoS TimeSliceSeries vs SoA signals), orthogonal to what the IDS is about." ;
    skos:inScheme fyo:core .

